 So she firmly decides that she needs to escape at any cost...<br><strong>But for free!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144590/extras/26bb9fded79fbbd44929746aaac01e76.poster.avif?t=1785220693\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144590/extras/26bb9fded79fbbd44929746aaac01e76.webm?t=1785220693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144590/extras/26bb9fded79fbbd44929746aaac01e76.mp4?t=1785220693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What we gonna do?</h2>You need to sneak away from Vitaly’s country residence in a luxurious silver Haval.<br>Unlock doors, break planks, open electrical panels, smash floors, throw dishes, distract Vitaly with loud noises, and enjoy PS4-era graphics!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144590/extras/b1069e12f4492d7f3d4693fb7678b935.poster.avif?t=1785220693\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144590/extras/b1069e12f4492d7f3d4693fb7678b935.webm?t=1785220693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144590/extras/b1069e12f4492d7f3d4693fb7678b935.mp4?t=1785220693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features of the Game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomized placement of items needed to escape this evil residence!<br></li><li>A mysterious admirer chasing you no matter where you hide.<br></li><li>A seductive heroine who leaves no one indifferent.<br></li><li>Multiple escape routes planned. Eventually.<br></li><li>Easter eggs galore!<br></li><li>